@startuml Y_Manager_Call_Chain
scale 2
!theme spacelab
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 45
caption v2.2.0 · 2026-09-07

title Dual Pipelines — Compression & Decompression (v2.2.0)

package "SFC_GUI" {
    class CompressionWorker {
        + doCompression() : void
        + doDecompression() : void
        + requestStop() : void
        .. signals (queued, thread-safe) ..
        + detailedProgress(file, filePct, overallPct, status)
        + finished(success, message)
    }
}

package "Y_Manager — Orchestrators" {
    class CompressionLoop {
        - progressCallback
        + compressionLoop(paths, mode, password)
        - readerLoop(..) : 借池块/编号/结算/进度与取消
        - workerLoop(..) : 压缩+两次加密,零池调用
        - writerLoop(..) : 定序/纯追加/攒回填表
    }
    class DecompressionLoop {
        - progressCallback
        + decompressionLoop(mode, password)
        - readerLoop(..) : 目录解密/数据区顺序读/FileStart
        - workerLoop(..) : 两次解密+解压,原地覆写
        - writerLoop(..) : 定序/按文件开关/追加
        - processLinks(..) : 链接最后重建
    }
}

package "ThreadPool — Reusable Components" {
    class "SafeQueue<T>" as SafeQueue {
        + push(T&&) : bool  「关后拒绝」
        + waitPop(T&) : bool  「排空契约」
        + setDone() : void  「notify_all」
    }
    class "WriteSorter<T>" as WriteSorter {
        + canWrite(seq, T&&) : bool  「区段连续判据」
        + takeInOrder() : vector<T>
        + drainAll() : vector<T>
    }
    class BufferPool {
        + acquire() : DataBlock  「背压点」
        + release(DataBlock&&) : void
        + close() : void
    }
}

package "Pipeline Messages (PipelineMessages.h)" {
    class BlockTask {
        + sequence
        + inputData : 池块(明文)
    }
    class PipelineMessage {
        + kind : Block | Settlement
        + encryptedMetadata / encryptedData(池块)
        + exception / processedSizeOffset
    }
    class DecompressTask {
        + sequence
        + expectedOriginal : 输出上限(预计算)
        + encryptedMetadata / encryptedData(池块,密文)
    }
    class DecompressionMessage {
        + kind : Block | FileStart
        + decompressedData(池块,明文)
        + exception / outputPath / originalSize
    }
}

package "CompressorFileSystem" {
    class StrategyFactory {
        + {static} createModules(mode, password)
        + {static} idToMode(id) / modeToId(mode)
    }
    class BinaryStandardLoader {
        + headerLoaderIterator(encryption)
        + takeBlockSpans() : 目录块位置表
        + fileQueue : FileTaskQueue
    }
    class DataLoader {
        + getBlock() : 内部缓冲引用,须复制
    }
    class DataExporter {
        + exportCompressedData / exportDecompressedData
        + currentFileProcessedSize() / startNextFile()
    }
    class HeaderWriter {
        + headerWriter(paths, out, root, mode)
    }
    class CatalogFinalizer {
        + finalize(sizeEntries, spans, enc, mode)
        「先回填大小槽,后目录区加密 — 次序焊死」
    }
}

CompressionWorker ..> HeaderWriter : ① 建档
CompressionWorker ..> CompressionLoop : ② (paths, mode, password)
CompressionWorker ..> DecompressionLoop : (mode, password)

CompressionLoop ..> SafeQueue : 任务/结果 ×2
CompressionLoop ..> BufferPool : 2×(N+2) × 8MB块
DecompressionLoop ..> SafeQueue
DecompressionLoop ..> BufferPool

CompressionLoop ..> BlockTask
CompressionLoop ..> PipelineMessage
DecompressionLoop ..> DecompressTask
DecompressionLoop ..> DecompressionMessage

CompressionLoop ..> WriteSorter : writer 私有
DecompressionLoop ..> WriteSorter : writer 私有

CompressionLoop ..> StrategyFactory : 每工人一份私有模块
DecompressionLoop ..> StrategyFactory : 读线程+每工人
CompressionLoop ..> BinaryStandardLoader : reader 独占
CompressionLoop ..> DataLoader : reader 独占
CompressionLoop ..> DataExporter : writer 独占(纯追加)
CompressionLoop ..> CatalogFinalizer : 排空后收尾
DecompressionLoop ..> BinaryStandardLoader : reader 独占(目录)
DecompressionLoop ..> DataExporter : writer 按文件开关

note as N1
  **Compression flow (3-stage pipeline):**
  1. reader: 借池块←DataLoader 复制,分配全局序号
  2. N workers: compress → encrypt ×2,池块原地变换(明文→密文)
  3. writer: WriteSorter 按序重组 → DataExporter 追加
  4. 排空后 CatalogFinalizer(回填+目录区加密)
  —— 池块全链路流动:读线程唯一借出,写线程唯一归还
end note

note as N2
  **Decompression flow:**
  1. reader: loader 目录解密 + 数据区专用流零 seek 顺序读
     FileStart 占号开文件,expectedOriginal 预计算
  2. N workers: decrypt ×2 → decompress 原地覆写(密文→明文)
  3. writer: 按序写出,FileStart 即结算上一文件
  4. 排空后 processLinks(链接严格最后)
  —— 集中关闭: join 读→关任务队列→join 工人→
     关结果队列→join 写→收尾→关池
end note

@enduml
